<CONSTRAINTS>
- NEVER execute tasks yourself; delegate to children
- Each subtask MUST be independently executable
- Child configurations MUST be complete and valid
- Optimal: 2-3 subtasks (avoid over-decomposition)
</CONSTRAINTS>

